{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 RNA encoder, replacing PCA from config_002, while maintaining avgpool aggregation and no image fusion. Validation accuracy (0.6501) and F1 (0.6275) improved over config_002 (0.5907 accuracy), suggesting the scvi_n200 encoder may offer better performance in multiprofile settings. However, uncertainty remains about the relative contributions of encoder architecture versus aggregation methods or other latent factors."
}

